  {
   "article_number": 138,
   "bab": 5,
   "article_title_ar": "مفهوم شركة المساهمة المبسطة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "0cab5fd6f3842f09125b3832443608fcb33af5b992bce0acafafa4a31f31a5a4",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "bee2be55d966fccd71ada04580d00e330c289d99d2c10eb1aba69f4a3236d742",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-138",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "7f3db84852547a8c8176d799a3aa6d13c72859c17efbce02a9c2a18dfd8e9ec7",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "简易股份公司凡本编无专门规定者，在与其性质相符的范围内，适用股份公司的规定，但下列各条除外：第（六十一）条、第（六十三）条、第（六十七）至（七十一）条、第（七十四）至（八十八）条、第（九十）至（九十四）条、第（九十五）条第（一）款、第（九十六）至（九十八）条、第（一百）条、第（一百零一）条、第（一百一十一）条第（二）款、第（一百二十一）条、第（一百二十二）条。\n简易股份公司的股东可以在公司章程中组织公司的架构及其运作方式。\n股东取代股份公司的普通股东大会和特别股东大会，其范围为适用于简易股份公司的规定；股东可以在公司章程中确定由谁行使该等职权，但本编另有专门规定者除外。\n简易股份公司的董事长、经理或董事会（视情形而定），行使为股份公司董事长及董事会成员所定的一切职权并取代其地位，但本编另有专门规定者除外。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "1f2892ff10497e152a4b1c1a64e6dcfcfcd443205aa4dc7cd2a3f383b3f2a66e",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 145,
   "bab": 5,
   "article_title_ar": "اجتماع المساهمين",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "e64302ddd2d09ab5a8d8e77bcafa11ac6cd76e7c3b5163e2c0b71be17fb375d8",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "69015f5fdaf23bebad7d1d71fab29a258b663936894bdfb907d7fecbbe4447f3",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-145",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "1dd91270bccbe8830547a03e1e7715f4bf7fda4a9ed827d161b62b3d99248825",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "简易股份公司的章程应确定须提交股东作出决议的事项，其形式和条件由该章程规定。但涉及增资、减资、公司转为其他形式、合并、分立、解散、任命审计师、讨论财务报表、分配利润或修改公司章程等属于股份公司普通或特别股东大会职权范围内的决议，须由股东作出。\n公司章程应确定股东会议有效召开及其决议有效作出所需的法定人数。\n公司章程可以就特定事项在提交股东并就其作出决议时确定不同的法定人数。\n公司章程应确定须经股东一致同意方可作出决议的事项。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "465d6f41f29e599a0148c043051eb49af1a08542460dc4b3f111690287596398",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 146,
   "bab": 5,
   "article_title_ar": "الدعوة إلى اجتماع المساهمين",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "106b4914a72e97336a183f4a5ce36faf4f84d9734cb88f3c3c5b148dedd271fd",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "0b98f48572a3d8355da4547cc3025c0eff63fa14996959575a9ed9b9600a943c",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-146",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "6ef3be4454f8824ca8721ed55478e935173edb092c09c7e8eb5b187d5ab02e40",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "在遵守公司章程的前提下，简易股份公司的股东会议由其董事长、经理或董事会（视情形而定）依照公司章程确定的方式召集。经审计师（如有）、或代表公司至少（百分之十）具表决权股份的一名或多名股东请求，亦可召集股东会议。\n会议召集通知应至少在其确定日期前（五）日发送给全体股东，载明会议地点、日期和时间，并附具载有要求股东表决事项的议程。召集通知可以确定在第一次会议未达到所需法定人数时第二次会议的地点、日期和时间。\n除公司章程另有规定外，应以挂号信发送至股东在股东名册所载地址、或通过现代技术手段通知股东召集事宜。\n若召集股东会议是为审议本法第（一百四十五）条第（一）款所规定的事项，则每一股东有权在会议确定日期前（五）日内的任何时间获取和查阅与之相关的信息和文件，公司章程规定更长期限的除外。\n股东会议在公司主要中心（总部）或股东确定的任何其他地点召开，并可通过现代技术手段召开。\n代表公司全部具表决权股份的股东，可以不受召集所定方式和期限的限制召开其会议。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "b1969dc66ae904f63a5ab70b32678bdde223d185ab911ceb4a2a74126de50ef7",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
